<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Flores &amp; Rucks raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Flores &amp; Rucks raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Bear Stearns &amp; Co has raised its rating for Flores &amp; Rucks Inc to buy from attractive, market sources said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>-- The company's shares rose 1-1/2 to 50 in mid-morning trade.</p>
<p>-- Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1730</p>
</text>
